        }
      ],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "If the Registrar notifies the person in the 14 days allowed by subsection 223(5) (reg 21.23), the document is taken as not filed or the act is taken as not done until the deficiency is made good."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "If the Registrar does not notify the person in the 14 days allowed by subsection 223(5) (reg 21.23), the document is taken to have been filed and the original receipt date is the filing date. However, the action required to be taken in relation to the document is not effected until the full fee is paid."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/4/4/1/5",
